# The wheel over the explorer scrolls its rows, three to a notch, and not the text.
# Forty files and a window with room for 28 rows to the status line: one notch
# down is three rows, so the first showing is the fourth file, row 3. The pointer
# has to be over the explorer for that, so it is moved there first. (With only
# thirty files there would be just two rows to scroll, and the scroll stops there.)
